23:50.150 --> 23:54.080
It's nice to watch from afar 
once in a while.

23:50.630 --> 23:51.920
It's a bad matchup.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.550
She simply has no openings.

23:52.470 --> 23:53.850
I can't read his attacks.

23:53.850 --> 23:54.350
I did it!

23:54.350 --> 23:56.470
This should be a good match.

23:54.660 --> 23:57.370
It's pointless trying 
to conceal your mana and hide.

23:56.460 --> 23:58.190
I shall put you out of your misery.

23:57.990 --> 24:00.070
Episode 36







A Magnificent End

23:58.190 --> 24:00.100
He met a magnificent end.
